<!DOCTYPE html><html><head><meta charset="UTF-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>Help - Sunrise Dental</title></head><body>
<jsp:include page="includes/header.jsp"/><main class="container"><div class="page-head"><div><h1>Staff Help</h1><div class="muted">Simple workflow for daily clinic operations.</div></div></div><div class="grid grid-2"><section class="panel"><h2>Appointment workflow</h2><ol><li>Open <strong>Appointments</strong>.</li><li>Enter patient contact details.</li><li>Select an available dentist and treatment.</li><li>Choose the appointment date and time.</li><li>Save the booking and keep the generated appointment number.</li><li>Use <strong>View</strong> or search by appointment number to open the record.</li><li>After treatment, mark it completed and generate the bill.</li></ol></section><section class="panel"><h2>System rules</h2><p>The system rejects missing required fields, invalid 10-digit contact numbers, past appointment dates and dentist time-slot conflicts.</p><p>Only administrators can open <strong>Staff Management</strong> and <strong>Audit Logs</strong>. Administrators can create staff accounts, deactivate access and reset passwords.</p><p>If a login fails after database setup, confirm that the SQL schema was imported and your MySQL connection settings match <code>DBConnection.java</code>.</p></section></div></main></body></html>
